1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,651
先出一个谜题
Here's a puzzle.

2
00:00:01,701 --> 00:00:06,843
这个项目的历史里存着上百个文件、半个 GB 的成品视频
This project's history holds hundreds of files and half a gigabyte of finished videos.

3
00:00:07,163 --> 00:00:08,850
现在，我来创建一个分支
Now, I create a branch.

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,908
一条命令——还没等这句话说完它就结束了
One command — and it finishes faster than this sentence.

5
00:00:12,228 --> 00:00:16,132
如果分支真的是复制整个项目，不可能这么快
If a branch really copied the project, that speed would be impossible.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,155
停一秒想一想：git 最少需要记下什么
So pause for a second. What is the smallest thing git could write down,

7
00:00:20,155 --> 00:00:21,955
才能记住一个分支？
to remember a branch?

8
00:00:29,067 --> 00:00:34,315
答案就在 .git 文件夹里一个很小的文件中：refs、heads、idea
The answer sits in one tiny file inside the dot git folder: refs, heads, idea.

9
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:38,819
四十一个字节：四十个字符写着某个提交的名字，外加一个换行符
Forty-one bytes: forty characters naming one commit, plus a newline.

10
00:00:39,139 --> 00:00:44,003
这就是整个分支——屏幕上的字节来自一个真实仓库
That is the entire branch — these exact bytes are from a real repository.

11
00:00:44,167 --> 00:00:45,717
什么都没有被复制
Nothing was copied.

12
00:00:45,767 --> 00:00:47,567
git 只写了一行字
Git wrote one line.

13
00:00:53,633 --> 00:00:55,980
真正的结构在提交里
The real structure lives in the commits.

14
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:00,716
每个提交保存一份文件快照，再记下它父提交的名字
Each commit stores a snapshot of your files, plus the name of its parent commit.

15
00:01:00,866 --> 00:01:03,810
顺着 parent 连起来，提交就串成一张图
Follow the parents, and the commits chain into a graph.

16
00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:07,117
项目的每一个版本，这张图里本来就都有
That graph already holds every version of the project.

17
00:01:07,266 --> 00:01:09,066
分支并不拥有这里的任何东西
A branch owns none of this.

18
00:01:09,122 --> 00:01:10,922
它只是指向其中一个节点
It simply points at one node.

19
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,900
看指针怎么干活
Watch the pointer do its job.

20
00:01:19,148 --> 00:01:23,159
你现在在 idea 上，另一个叫 HEAD 的指针记住了这件事
You are on idea, and a second pointer, called HEAD, remembers that.

21
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:27,298
提交。 git 保存新的快照、记下它的 parent——
Commit. Git stores the new snapshot, records its parent —

22
00:01:27,298 --> 00:01:31,888
然后只移动一个指针：idea 现在指向新的提交
and then moves exactly one pointer. Idea now names the new commit.

23
00:01:32,067 --> 00:01:33,553
main 一动没动
Main never moved.

24
00:01:33,603 --> 00:01:37,507
两个分支之间的全部差别，就是两个小文件
The entire difference between your two branches is two small files.

25
00:01:37,667 --> 00:01:42,659
想一想：如果分支只是一个指针，那「在某个分支上」到底是什么意思？
Think about it: if a branch is just a pointer, what does being on a branch actually mean?

26
00:01:51,233 --> 00:01:56,246
git switch main 移动的是 HEAD，然后按 main 的快照重建你的工作目录
Git switch main moves HEAD back, and rebuilds your working folder from main's snapshot.

27
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:58,057
idea 没有丢失任何东西
Nothing about idea is lost.

28
00:01:58,057 --> 00:02:02,842
它那四十一个字节仍然指着它的提交，图里也保留着每一份快照
Its forty-one bytes still name its commit, and the graph keeps every snapshot.

29
00:02:07,633 --> 00:02:12,156
回到 main，git merge idea 会创建一个新的提交——它有两个父亲
Back on main, git merge idea creates one new commit — with two parents.

30
00:02:12,476 --> 00:02:15,889
一条血缘来自 main，一条来自 idea
One line of ancestry comes from main, one from idea.

31
00:02:16,566 --> 00:02:22,582
这是真实的：就在这个仓库里，最新的一次合并提交恰好写着两行 parent
This is real: the newest merge in this very repository lists exactly two parent lines.

32
00:02:22,733 --> 00:02:26,104
图里多了一个节点，main 往前挪了一行
The graph grew by one node, and main moved by one line.

33
00:02:26,424 --> 00:02:28,224
合并就只是这么一回事
That's all a merge is.

34
00:02:34,167 --> 00:02:37,141
回顾一下。 分支是一个四十一字节的指针
Recap. A branch is a forty-one byte pointer.

35
00:02:37,141 --> 00:02:40,183
提交和它们的 parent 才是真正的图
Commits and their parents are the real graph.

36
00:02:40,334 --> 00:02:45,262
提交会移动当前分支的指针；合并则是加入一个有两个父亲的提交
Committing moves the current branch's pointer. Merging adds one commit with two parents.

37
00:02:45,434 --> 00:02:48,826
所以分支才几乎零成本——放心大胆地为每件事开分支
That is why branches are free — so make one for everything.

38
00:02:49,146 --> 00:02:53,455
然后打开 .git/refs/heads，亲眼读一读你的分支
Then open dot git, refs, heads, and read your branch with your own eyes.
